  "problem": "$|\\frac{11}{5}|\\,=\\,${{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "The absolute value of a positive number equals the number:\n\n$$\n|\\frac{11}{5}|\\,=\\frac{11}{5}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of a number gives the distance between the number and zero on a number line.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14145654/assets/046cc364cb81f8fbadbc9bb78a70e7b30b780e0ed845b9517d00f9ef17d23eee.png)",
